### 1. Полное одобрение (APPROVED — Grade A, 16% годовых)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555501",
  "applicantAgeYears": 32,
  "monthlyIncome": 500000.00,
  "existingMonthlyPayments": 50000.00,
  "creditScore": 780,
  "hasActiveDelinquency": false,
  "maxDelinquencyDaysLast12Months": 0,
  "requestedAmount": 2000000.00,
  "requestedTermMonths": 24
}

### 2. Умный контр-оффер (COUNTER_OFFER — Вариант А со снижением суммы + Вариант Б с увеличением срока)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555502",
  "applicantAgeYears": 32,
  "monthlyIncome": 450000.00,
  "existingMonthlyPayments": 80000.00,
  "creditScore": 710,
  "hasActiveDelinquency": false,
  "maxDelinquencyDaysLast12Months": 0,
  "requestedAmount": 3000000.00,
  "requestedTermMonths": 12
}

### 3. Отказ по стоп-факторам (REJECTED — активная просрочка и низкий балл)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555503",
  "applicantAgeYears": 25,
  "monthlyIncome": 600000.00,
  "existingMonthlyPayments": 0.00,
  "creditScore": 480,
  "hasActiveDelinquency": true,
  "maxDelinquencyDaysLast12Months": 45,
  "requestedAmount": 1000000.00,
  "requestedTermMonths": 12
}

### 4. Проверка идемпотентности (повтор requestId из Запроса №1 возвращает тот же decisionId)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "11111111-2222-3333-4444-555555555501",
  "applicantAgeYears": 32,
  "monthlyIncome": 500000.00,
  "existingMonthlyPayments": 50000.00,
  "creditScore": 780,
  "hasActiveDelinquency": false,
  "maxDelinquencyDaysLast12Months": 0,
  "requestedAmount": 2000000.00,
  "requestedTermMonths": 24
}

### 5. История решений с пагинацией
GET http://localhost:8080/api/decisions?page=0&size=20
Accept: application/json

### 6. Ошибка валидации (400 Bad Request)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/decisions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "applicantAgeYears": 16,
  "monthlyIncome": -100,
  "creditScore": 950,
  "requestedTermMonths": 3
}
